# 개발 서버와 기존 check/build 명령에 필요한 파일만 전달한다.
**
!frontend/
frontend/*
!frontend/package.json
!frontend/package-lock.json
!frontend/index.html
!frontend/vite.config.ts
!frontend/tsconfig*.json
!frontend/eslint.config.js
!frontend/.prettierrc.json
!frontend/.prettierignore
!frontend/src/
!frontend/src/**
!frontend/public/
!frontend/public/**
!specs/
specs/*
!specs/mocks/
specs/mocks/*
!specs/mocks/accounts.json
!specs/mocks/fixtures.json
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
